     "type": "text",
     "text": "I declined the one request in the inbox, m1, and the inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was a 5,000 USD order from AcmeCorp (PO-1401, 250 units of X-200). The Attest gate refused it with the reason \"unstaked_money_action\": AcmeCorp has no stake behind it, and SupplierCo's policy requires at least 10,000 USD from any operator whose agent places an order. The gate's receipt signature verified.\n\nThe credential and mandate chain otherwise looked fine. The mandate allows orders up to 10,000 USD and runs until 2026-12-04. The missing stake alone is enough to refuse an order that ships on credit.\n\nThe decline tells the sender that a public price quote is still available."
    }
